        <li>These Terms are available in Chinese and English; if they differ, the Chinese version prevails, except where mandatory local law provides otherwise.</li>
        <li>Contact: Zhangjiakou SENO Biotech Co., Ltd., martin@senobiocorp.com, Phone | WeChat +86 15612372623, Building 3, North Silicon Valley, Qiaodong District, Zhangjiakou, Hebei, China.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
